      (L2) the antisymmetric exterior power on the terminal carrier CLOSES beyond capacity
           (`⋀^N ImO = 0` for `N > 7`);
      (L3) the modular filling RESTARTS at capacity (overfill `Subsingleton`, restart `Nontrivial`);
      (L4) the universal critical exponent is `1 / assoc3NormSq`;
    all threaded by the ONE CAUSE: `O ℚ` is non-associative (`not_associative`), its imaginary
    dimension is `7`, and its structure-3-form norm equals the interaction-channel count
    (`assoc3NormSq = imChannelCount (finrank ℚ ImO)` = 42). This is NOT a hollow conjunction of
